{"id":"b0323b86d2825eb9","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-array-computable.md","title":"阵列可计算度与非可计算度","display":"df-array-computable — 阵列可计算度与非可计算度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-array-computable","aliases":["43-df-array-computable"],"display":"df-array-computable — 阵列可计算度与非可计算度","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 5.21.2 and the bounded-mind-change characterization immediately preceding it","source_printed_pages":"80","source_pdf_pages":"100","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-array-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-array-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-array-computable — 阵列可计算度与非可计算度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.21.2 and the bounded-mind-change characterization immediately preceding it"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"80"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"100"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,g,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 均全定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}\\)</span> 是下式定义的辅助谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}(f)\\iff\\exists h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(p)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left((\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow h(n,s)=f(n)))\\land|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:h(n,s+1)\\ne h(n,s)\\}|\\le p(n)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}(f)\\iff\\exists h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(p)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left((\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow h(n,s)=f(n)))\\land|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:h(n,s+1)\\ne h(n,s)\\}|\\le p(n)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}(f)\\land\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(g\\le_TA\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow g(n)&lt;f(n))\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}(f)\\land\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(g\\le_TA\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow g(n)&lt;f(n))\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}(A)\\iff\\neg\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ArrayNoncomputable}(A)\\iff\\neg\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个候选逼近都可代入最终常值公式；没有极限时该公式为假。变更数界与最终支配的量词顺序保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 5.21.2 and the bounded-mind-change characterization immediately preceding it。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$f,g,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$、$h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 均全定义。$\\operatorname{Computable}$、$\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}$ 是下式定义的辅助谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$f,g,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$、$h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 均全定义。$\\operatorname{Computable}$、$\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。$\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}$ 是下式定义的辅助谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoundedChangeLimit}(f)\\iff\\exists h:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}(h)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(p)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left((\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow h(n,s)=f(n)))\\land|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:h(n,s+1)\\ne h(n,s)\\}|\\le p(n)\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArrayComputable}(A)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\